WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.755 --> 00:00:11.056
&gt;&gt; Laura: A NEW INSTALLMENT IN

00:00:11.057 --> 00:00:13.959
OUR RAYMOND ON THE ROAD SERIES

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:14.426
TONIGHT.

00:00:14.427 --> 00:00:15.894
RAYMOND ARROYO IN SOUTH BEND,

00:00:15.895 --> 00:00:17.129
INDIANA, NOW THE HOME OF

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:17.596
PETE BUTTIGIEG.

00:00:17.597 --> 00:00:20.265
BUT WHAT DOES THE MAYOR'S REAL

00:00:20.266 --> 00:00:21.533
RECORD LOOK LIKE FROM THE

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:21.934
GROUND?

00:00:21.935 --> 00:00:24.136
&gt;&gt; FROM THE LOOKS OF THINGS YOU

00:00:24.137 --> 00:00:26.472
MIGHT LOOK LIKE I'M IN ST. LOUIS

00:00:26.473 --> 00:00:28.474
OR DETROIT BUT ACTUALLY I'M ONLY

00:00:28.475 --> 00:00:31.577
A FEW MILES FROM THE GOLDEN DOME

00:00:31.578 --> 00:00:34.079
OF NOTRE DAME.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:34.680
WELCOME TO MAYOR PETE'S,

00:00:34.681 --> 00:00:35.247
SOUTH BEND, INDIANA.

00:00:35.248 --> 00:00:37.816
A PLACE WHERE THE LOCAL

00:00:37.817 --> 00:00:39.585
POPULATION HERE, 25% OF THEM

00:00:39.586 --> 00:00:41.620
LIVE BENEATH THE POVERTY LINE

00:00:41.621 --> 00:00:44.223
AND CRIME HAS RISEN TO THE 20

00:00:44.224 --> 00:00:45.290
YEAR HIGHS WITH VIOLENT ASSAULTS

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:49.027
EXCEEDING BY 173% THE NATIONAL

00:00:49.028 --> 00:00:49.361
AVERAGE.

00:00:49.362 --> 00:00:52.464
AND IF THERE ARE LOTS OF

00:00:52.465 --> 00:00:53.732
ABANDONED HOMES HERE.

00:00:53.733 --> 00:00:54.433
"USA TODAY" RECENTLY DESCRIBED

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:56.435
SOUTH BEND AS ONE OF THE MOST

00:00:56.436 --> 00:00:58.070
DANGEROUS CITIES IN AMERICA.

00:00:58.071 --> 00:01:00.239
THEY SAY IT'S DOUBLED THE AND

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:05.377
STATE AVERAGE FOR ASSAULTS.

00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:05.944
WHAT'S HAPPENING HERE?

00:01:05.945 --> 00:01:08.046
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A MIRROR THAT IS MORE

00:01:08.047 --> 00:01:09.348
CONCERNED ABOUT POLITICS RIGHT

00:01:09.349 --> 00:01:10.983
NOW THAN HE IS ABOUT PUBLIC

00:01:10.984 --> 00:01:14.787
SAFETY IN OUR OWN CITY.

00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:15.754
IT'S INFURIATING.

00:01:15.755 --> 00:01:19.057
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE OF SOME OF THE

00:01:19.058 --> 00:01:20.159
RHETORIC HERE AT HOME AND

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.561
NATIONALLY, AS IT MADE IT MORE

00:01:22.562 --> 00:01:24.763
DIFFICULT FOR YOU TO DO YOUR

00:01:24.764 --> 00:01:25.430
JOB?

00:01:25.431 --> 00:01:27.833
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:30.302
NOW THE PUBLIC SEES US AS

00:01:30.303 --> 00:01:30.669
VILLAINS.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:32.838
AND MORALE IS AT AN ALL-TIME LOW

00:01:32.839 --> 00:01:34.673
AS FAR AS I'M CONCERNED.

00:01:34.674 --> 00:01:36.575
I'VE BEEN A POLICE OFFICER HERE

00:01:36.576 --> 00:01:37.276
FOR 27 YEARS AND THIS IS THE

00:01:37.277 --> 00:01:40.345
LOWEST I'VE EVER SEEN IT.

00:01:40.346 --> 00:01:41.380
IT'S MAINLY DUE TO THE MAYOR'S

00:01:41.381 --> 00:01:44.116
LACK OF PUBLIC SUPPORT FOR OUR

00:01:44.117 --> 00:01:45.517
OFFICERS.

00:01:45.518 --> 00:01:48.587
&gt;&gt; TELL US ABOUT THE ERIC LOGAN

00:01:48.588 --> 00:01:48.887
CASE.

00:01:48.888 --> 00:01:52.224
&gt;&gt; MORE THAN TEN OFFICERS HAVE

00:01:52.225 --> 00:01:55.294
BEEN SHOT AT SINCE THAT SHOOTIN

00:01:55.295 --> 00:01:55.661
SHOOTING.

00:01:55.662 --> 00:01:59.097
&gt;&gt; TO WHAT DO YOU ATTRIBUTE

00:01:59.098 --> 00:02:01.400
THAT?

00:02:01.401 --> 00:02:05.971
&gt;&gt; THE PUBLIC IS NOW AFRAID TO

00:02:05.972 --> 00:02:06.371
APPROACH US.

00:02:06.372 --> 00:02:10.342
&gt;&gt; DO YOU FEEL SAFE IN

00:02:10.343 --> 00:02:10.742
SOUTH BEND?

00:02:10.743 --> 00:02:12.110
&gt;&gt; NOT AT ALL.

00:02:12.111 --> 00:02:14.880
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T WAIT TO GET OUT.

00:02:14.881 --> 00:02:16.381
&gt;&gt; I FEEL LIKE I'M ON

00:02:16.382 --> 00:02:16.782
GAILLARDIA.

00:02:16.783 --> 00:02:17.482
&gt;&gt; I'M OKAY WITH WHERE I'M NOT

00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:20.786
BUT THERE'S STUFF THAT GOES ON

00:02:20.787 --> 00:02:21.486
DOWNTOWN AND OTHER AREAS THAT

00:02:21.487 --> 00:02:22.688
NEEDS TO BE ADDRESSED.

00:02:22.689 --> 00:02:25.457
&gt;&gt; DO YOU GO DOWNTOWN IN

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:25.858
SOUTH BEND?

00:02:25.859 --> 00:02:28.460
&gt;&gt; SOMETIMES I DO, IT'S A LOT OF

00:02:28.461 --> 00:02:29.161
FIGHTING.

00:02:29.162 --> 00:02:30.829
&gt;&gt; I DON'T GO DOWNTOWN.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.632
MY 15-YEAR-OLD DOESN'T LIKE TO

00:02:33.633 --> 00:02:34.933
BE OUT ALONE AT NIGHT.

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:39.037
&gt;&gt; IS THERE HOMELESS?

00:02:39.038 --> 00:02:41.106
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE ALL OVER THE CITY.

00:02:41.107 --> 00:02:44.643
&gt;&gt; 25% LIVE BELOW THE POVERTY

00:02:44.644 --> 00:02:45.077
LEVEL.

00:02:45.078 --> 00:02:47.613
&gt;&gt; GIVEN WHAT YOU WITNESSED AND

00:02:47.614 --> 00:02:50.249
LIVED UNDER, IS HE READY TO

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:50.849
ASSUME NATIONAL OFFICE?

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.352
&gt;&gt; I DON'T BELIEVE SO.

00:02:53.353 --> 00:02:55.053
MY MESSAGE TO THE MAYOR IS TO

00:02:55.054 --> 00:02:55.854
DROP THE POLITICS AND BE A

00:02:55.855 --> 00:02:59.291
LEADER FOR THE CITY THAT HE

00:02:59.292 --> 00:03:01.193
SWORE TO BE A LEADER FOR.

00:03:01.194 --> 00:03:04.396
&gt;&gt; AND THEN THERE IS MAYOR PETE

00:03:04.397 --> 00:03:06.832
MAYOR PETE'S RECORD ON ABORTION.

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:09.968
IN 2008, THE WOMEN'S CARE

00:03:09.969 --> 00:03:11.169
CENTER, A PRO-LIFE CRISIS CENTER

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.473
WANTED TO OPEN UP A FACILITY

00:03:14.474 --> 00:03:16.441
NEXT TO THAT BUILDING.

00:03:16.442 --> 00:03:19.011
THE CITY COUNCIL APPROVED THEIR

00:03:19.012 --> 00:03:20.779
PERMIT BUT MAYOR PETE VETOED IT.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.848
&gt;&gt; WE PURCHASED A BUILDING THAT

00:03:22.849 --> 00:03:26.919
NEEDED TO BE REZONED AND WHEN WE

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:27.920
BROUGHT IT TO THE CITY COUNCIL

00:03:27.921 --> 00:03:30.589
THAT APPROVED THE ZONING, IT WAS

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:30.989
VETOED.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:33.191
THE OWNER OF THE PROPERTY HERE

00:03:33.192 --> 00:03:35.994
WHERE WE STAND ACROSS THE STREET

00:03:35.995 --> 00:03:38.096
CONTACTED US AND OFFERED US HIS

00:03:38.097 --> 00:03:38.463
PROPERTY.

00:03:38.464 --> 00:03:42.401
SO WE BUILT HERE AND HERE WE ARE

00:03:42.402 --> 00:03:46.405
SERVING WOMEN ON THE WEST SIDE

00:03:46.406 --> 00:03:47.039
OF SOUTH BEND.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:47.806
JUSTICE DEMANDS THAT EVERY WOMAN

00:03:47.807 --> 00:03:54.980
IN THIS COMMUNITY, HAS THE

00:03:54.981 --> 00:03:58.850
OPPORTUNITY TO CHOOSE LIFE.

00:03:58.851 --> 00:04:01.720
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN SEE IT'S NOT EXACTLY

00:04:01.721 --> 00:04:04.856
POPULATED IN THE AFTERNOON BUT

00:04:04.857 --> 00:04:05.557
MAYOR PETE HAS INSTIGATED

00:04:05.558 --> 00:04:06.425
INVESTMENTS DOWNTOWN.

00:04:06.426 --> 00:04:08.527
THERE IS SOME NEW CONSTRUCTION.

00:04:08.528 --> 00:04:09.594
THE STUDEBAKER FACTORY HERE WAS

00:04:09.595 --> 00:04:12.230
A RECENTLY TURNED INTO A TECH

00:04:12.231 --> 00:04:12.731
HUB.

00:04:12.732 --> 00:04:15.067
BUT THE QUESTION IS CAN THE

00:04:15.068 --> 00:04:17.569
RESIDENCE AFFORD TO LIVE IN

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.937
THESE NEW HIGH-RISES?

00:04:18.938 --> 00:04:22.174
&gt;&gt; I HAVE TWO CHILDREN, 24 AND

00:04:22.175 --> 00:04:22.874
25, I DON'T THINK THEY COULD

00:04:22.875 --> 00:04:26.044
AFFORD TO LIVE IN THOSE SPACES.

00:04:26.045 --> 00:04:28.413
&gt;&gt; I DON'T SEE A LOT OF

00:04:28.414 --> 00:04:29.014
OPPORTUNITY IN THE CITY.

00:04:29.015 --> 00:04:30.382
&gt;&gt; I DEFINITELY THINK IT'S FOR

00:04:30.383 --> 00:04:32.985
THOSE WHO HAVE MONEY RATHER THAN

00:04:32.986 --> 00:04:33.418
THE RESIDENCE.

00:04:33.419 --> 00:04:39.024
&gt;&gt; IS MAYOR PETE READY?

00:04:39.025 --> 00:04:40.225
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:04:40.226 --> 00:04:43.095
I DON'T AGREE WITH ANYTHING ON

00:04:43.096 --> 00:04:46.999
THIS PLATFORM.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.633
&gt;&gt; I LIKE MAYOR PETE.

00:04:48.634 --> 00:04:51.103
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T SEE HIM STANDING

00:04:51.104 --> 00:04:52.571
TOE-TO-TOE WITH FOOD AND OR

00:04:52.572 --> 00:04:53.238
OTHER LEADERS.

00:04:53.239 --> 00:04:54.639
WHAT HE'S DONE WITH THE CITY, HE

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.643
HASN'T REALLY CHANGED TOO MUCH.

00:04:58.644 --> 00:05:00.045
&gt;&gt; Laura: IT RAYMOND ARROYO

00:05:00.046 --> 00:05:01.880
JOINS ME NOW.

00:05:01.881 --> 00:05:04.016
TERRIFIC REPORTING THERE.

00:05:04.017 --> 00:05:04.649
WHAT'S YOUR IMPRESSION OF

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:05.050
SOUTH BEND?

00:05:05.051 --> 00:05:07.152
I'VE ONLY BEEN THERE A COUPLE

00:05:07.153 --> 00:05:10.155
TIMES BECAUSE OF FOOTBALL GAMES

00:05:10.156 --> 00:05:13.325
OR WHATEVER AND NOTRE DAME.

00:05:13.326 --> 00:05:15.727
BUT AT LEAST THE PEOPLE YOU

00:05:15.728 --> 00:05:17.396
INTERVIEWED, THEY SAID IT

00:05:17.397 --> 00:05:18.597
DOESN'T SEEM LIKE HE'S DOING HIS

00:05:18.598 --> 00:05:21.400
JOB AT HOME LET ALONE FOR THE

00:05:21.401 --> 00:05:23.635
COUNTRY.

00:05:23.636 --> 00:05:26.438
&gt;&gt; A LOT OF THESE PEOPLE REALLY

00:05:26.439 --> 00:05:26.905
LIKE MAYOR PETE.

00:05:26.906 --> 00:05:29.641
THEY GIVE HIM CREDIT.

00:05:29.642 --> 00:05:31.443
THIS NEW ART CENTER HAS BEEN

00:05:31.444 --> 00:05:32.277
REFURBISHED BUT THE STREETS ARE

00:05:32.278 --> 00:05:33.378
EMPTY.

00:05:33.379 --> 00:05:35.747
THIS IS A DAYLONG APPROACH TO

00:05:35.748 --> 00:05:37.549
THE AREA, IT LOOKS LIKE IT'S

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.618
ABANDONED OR A GHOST TOWN.

00:05:39.619 --> 00:05:41.420
ON THE OTHER SIDE THEY SAY THEY

00:05:41.421 --> 00:05:42.487
FEEL UNSAFE.

00:05:42.488 --> 00:05:45.624
THEY ARE WORRIED ABOUT AND

00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:46.124
VIOLENT ASSAULTS.

00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:48.994
NOT ONLY HEAR ABOUT IN THE

00:05:48.995 --> 00:05:49.795
NEIGHBORHOOD.

00:05:49.796 --> 00:05:51.797
HE SAW THE HOMELESS PROBLEM WE

00:05:51.798 --> 00:05:54.066
UNCOVERED, AND THE HEAD OF THE

00:05:54.067 --> 00:05:56.668
POLICE UNION THERE, HARVEY

00:05:56.669 --> 00:05:57.969
MILLS, SHARED MORE INFORMATION

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:01.039
WITH US ABOUT THE DRUG UNIT

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:01.807
BEING SHRUNKEN BY MAYOR PETE AS

00:06:01.808 --> 00:06:02.874
WELL AS TRAFFIC ENFORCEMENT.

00:06:02.875 --> 00:06:05.210
WE HAVE MORE TO SHARE WITH YOU

00:06:05.211 --> 00:06:08.481
LATER IN THE SHOW.

